WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.947
When Mandy woke up, the house was very quiet.

2
00:00:05.948 --> 00:00:10.440
Vinnie was already awake and eating breakfast.

3
00:00:10.441 --> 00:00:14.972
Mom was in the kitchen reading the newspaper.

4
00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:17.652
Mandy grabbed a banana.

5
00:00:17.653 --> 00:00:20.734
"Where's Dad?" she asked.

6
00:00:20.735 --> 00:00:24.413
"He had a business meeting," said Mom.

7
00:00:24.414 --> 00:00:28.146
"He went to the city early this morning."

8
00:00:28.147 --> 00:00:31.596
Mandy barely heard what Mom was saying.

9
00:00:31.597 --> 00:00:34.912
All she could think about was the attic.

10
00:00:34.913 --> 00:00:38.735
If Dad was out, then it was empty!

11
00:00:38.736 --> 00:00:41.583
Mandy looked over at Vinnie.

12
00:00:41.584 --> 00:00:44.713
He was looking back at her, grinning.

13
00:00:44.714 --> 00:00:48.123
"Let's go!" he whispered.

14
00:00:48.124 --> 00:00:52.655
A minute later the two kids ran up the stairs.

15
00:00:52.656 --> 00:00:56.816
Vinnie pulled the photo album from its hiding spot.

16
00:00:56.817 --> 00:01:02.919
They flipped toward the end and noticed there were just two pages left.

17
00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:06.982
But neither one said anything about it.

18
00:01:06.983 --> 00:01:08.750
"There he is!"

19
00:01:08.751 --> 00:01:12.509
Mandy spotted the old man in the photo.

20
00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:18.890
He stood in front of a building with three large, glowing gates.

21
00:01:18.891 --> 00:01:22.338
Vinnie and Mandy stared at the photo.

22
00:01:22.339 --> 00:01:28.882
Seconds later they tumbled into the dark tunnel.

23
00:01:28.883 --> 00:01:32.686
Mandy and Vinnie landed on their backs.

24
00:01:32.687 --> 00:01:36.330
They lay on the floor of a small room.

25
00:01:36.331 --> 00:01:40.266
Mandy sat up and then looked at Vinnie.

26
00:01:40.267 --> 00:01:44.788
"Does this floor feel warm?" she asked.

27
00:01:44.789 --> 00:01:47.410
"Yes," said Vinnie.

28
00:01:47.411 --> 00:01:49.564
He sat up too.

29
00:01:49.565 --> 00:01:53.761
"I hope there isn't a fire," said Mandy.

30
00:01:53.762 --> 00:01:57.809
She leaped to her feet and looked around.

31
00:01:57.810 --> 00:02:03.439
Suddenly the door opened, and a boy entered the room.

32
00:02:03.440 --> 00:02:07.353
He jumped back when he saw Mandy and Vinnie.

33
00:02:07.354 --> 00:02:10.820
"Who are you?" the boy demanded.

34
00:02:10.821 --> 00:02:14.062
"What are you doing here?"

35
00:02:14.063 --> 00:02:18.637
"Uh, well, I, uh…" stuttered Vinnie.

36
00:02:18.638 --> 00:02:25.341
"Uh . . . I'm Mandy, and this is my brother, Vinnie," said Mandy.

37
00:02:25.342 --> 00:02:29.433
"The floor is very warm!" she added.

38
00:02:29.434 --> 00:02:33.818
"Is . . . is your house on fire?"

39
00:02:33.819 --> 00:02:38.620
The boy stared at Mandy for a moment, confused.

40
00:02:38.621 --> 00:02:41.769
Then he burst out laughing.

41
00:02:41.770 --> 00:02:44.058
"My home is not on fire!

42
00:02:44.059 --> 00:02:46.632
Our floors are heated!"

43
00:02:46.633 --> 00:02:50.212
He shook his head, still laughing.

44
00:02:50.213 --> 00:02:53.858
"Don't you have heated floors in your house?"

45
00:02:53.859 --> 00:02:57.152
Mandy blushed and shook her head.

46
00:02:57.153 --> 00:03:00.592
She felt silly for saying something.

47
00:03:00.593 --> 00:03:05.546
"Follow me, and I will show you how it works," the boy continued.

48
00:03:05.547 --> 00:03:08.677
"My name is Gildong, by the way."

49
00:03:08.678 --> 00:03:11.407
He led them to the kitchen.

50
00:03:11.408 --> 00:03:16.810
"Heat from the stove warms stones under the floor," he explained.

51
00:03:16.811 --> 00:03:19.487
"That is how the floor stays hot."

52
00:03:19.488 --> 00:03:22.800
"Wow," said Vinnie.

53
00:03:22.801 --> 00:03:26.279
"That's cool!" Mandy added.

54
00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:30.775
"I mean warm," she joked.

55
00:03:30.776 --> 00:03:33.729
"Come," Gildong said.

56
00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:36.628
They followed him to the porch.

57
00:03:36.629 --> 00:03:42.379
He reached for a bamboo basket and began wrapping it in cloth.

58
00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:46.453
"I have an important errand," he explained.

59
00:03:46.454 --> 00:03:50.027
"I must bring these bowls to a nobleman's house.

60
00:03:50.028 --> 00:03:53.830
His family is having a special ceremony tonight.

61
00:03:53.831 --> 00:03:56.093
Would you like to come with me?"

62
00:03:56.094 --> 00:04:03.705
"Yes!" cried Vinnie and Mandy together.

